flowchart LR
    A[Immutable approved and action-time evidence] --> R[Historical preflight replay]
    P[Canonical cleanup action plan] --> Q[Deterministic plan replay]
    R --> Q
    O[Exact outcome bundle and credential scan] --> C[Schema-v2 completion replay]
    Q --> C
    CR[Retained cleanup completion report] --> C
    C --> G{Complete, exact, retention active?}
    G -->|No| F[Fail closed; no ledger]
    G -->|Yes| L[Canonical operator closeout ledger]
    L --> V[Independent full replay at retained timestamp]

    X[No stop, remove, revoke, migrate, delete, or trade capability] -. constrains .-> R
    X -. constrains .-> C
    X -. constrains .-> V
